    "raw": "Today, my buddy Maple and I found a weird, but adorable little cat-thing. I've never seen anything like it, and Maple insists that it's a cat. I mean, it looks a lot like a cat. It's fluffy, it kinda meows, it has four legs, and it has sharp teeth. It's just... really fat, and drools some sort of nasty metal goo. Makes my skin itch. Maple decided to name our new cat ''Squiggles''.",
